cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Nomos"
abstract: >-
  Mobile application for environmental inventories, built as an extensible
  platform capable of hosting multiple field survey protocols. Its initial
  version operationalizes a geosystemic protocol for landscape cartography,
  developed as part of master's research linked to the Graduate Program in
  Geography (PPGEO) at the Federal University of Pernambuco (UFPE).
authors:
